            "heading": "Product Details",
            "content": "<p>Designed to fill the gap between your lower back and the seat, Module Nest uses a sculpted dual-wing shape to cradle the lumbar area without locking you into one position. Its flexible 3D lattice responds as you shift, helping spread contact pressure while the open structure keeps air moving. Lightweight and easy to reposition, it fits naturally into desk chairs, sofas, and car seats.</p><ul><li>Sculpted dual-wing lumbar profile</li><li>Responsive open-cell 3D lattice</li><li>Lightweight, one-piece construction</li><li>Easy to move between chairs, sofas, and car seats</li></ul>",
